  sentence: 
  dialogues:
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Bom dia, meu querido! Como esta sua manha?
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Alex
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b87ca18a4d5545e16b0324e2545547c7, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Tudo tranquilo. Acabei de chegar na fazenda.
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Que bom ver as terras do Otavio cuidadas de novo.
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Mas volte para casa antes de escurecer, ouviu?
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Alex
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b87ca18a4d5545e16b0324e2545547c7, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Por que? O que acontece de noite?
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Desde que seu avo partiu, os ossos andam pelos campos...
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Passe la em casa um dia. Farei torta de cenoura!
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Ah, e agora eu vendo sementes! Trigo, repolho, morango...
      english: 
      spanish: 
  - actorName: Jasmine
    profile: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cf05aada6a1dbf1f58ebc31beb17b0f8, type: 3}
    sentences:
      portuguese: Fale comigo de novo quando quiser comprar.
      english: 
      spanish: 
